# Connector: No obstante
<!-- id: c1_connector_no_obstante | level: C1 | topic: connectors | type: cloze -->

> **Grammar Rule**: 'No obstante' (nevertheless / however) is an adversarial connector followed by the indicative.

### Context
English: "It was cold; nevertheless, we went swimming."

### Exercise
Hacía frío; no obstante, nosotros (ir) ___ a nadar.

<!-- SOLUTION
fuimos
